At 320x568:
- Topbar brand overlaps the match meta: "LP TO 0" and "YOUR TURN" overlap at top left, with "0 YOUR TURN" weird. The match meta is too wide for 320 and collides. Need fix for ≤360 or so: hide match-meta or shorten to just phase? At 320, brand ~100, meta ~140, buttons 4*29+gaps=~125 -> total 365 > 320. Since HUD buttons take ~125, brand 100, meta 140, impossible. Need reduce: at max-width 480, hide the "24 ZONE DUEL" part and perhaps show just "TURN 01"? Or hide match-meta entirely on very small screens, keeping maybe phase label in board. To avoid overlap, at max-width 380 hide match-meta or only show `#phaseLabel`? The topbar can display brand + phase + buttons. Compute: brand 100 + phase "YOUR TURN" ~50 + gaps 24 + buttons 4*29+9=125 = 299, fits. Hide separators, 24 ZONE DUEL, turn label. Could hide `.match-meta .meta-sep`, `span:nth-of-type(4)` (24 zone duel? markup spans: live-dot 1, phase 2, meta-sep 3, 24 4, meta-sep 5, turn 6). At ≤360, show phase only; hide spans 3-6. But `span:last-child` etc. Use `.match-meta span:nth-of-type(n+3) { display:none; }` and maybe hide live dot too? Keep live dot? It's first span. At 320, live-dot 5px + phase ~45 + gaps = 55, good. Brand ~100 + meta 55 + buttons 125 + gaps 24 = 304, fits. At 375, there's 375-304=71 extra; can show turn label? not needed. Keep phase only for ≤360 or ≤480. But at 375 screenshot previously meta showed "YOUR TURN / 24 ZONE DUEL" and fit? At 375: brand 100 + meta ~140 + buttons 125 + gaps 24 = 389 > 375, and indeed it may have overlapped? The screenshot at 375 showed "LP TO 0 YOUR TURN / 24 ZONE DUEL" with no overlap? It was tight but okaybecause buttons are 29*4 + 3*3=125 and meta maybe 135, brand 98, total 358 + justify-between, fits in 375 (content 363). At 320 it doesn't. So at ≤360 hide the extras.

Also at 320, the board: hand cards overlap and are clipped left/right? The hand shows 6 cards from x 8 to 240, okay. But the command line "カードを選択" at bottom and END TURN, fine. Player panel shows name and LP. The board fits. The hand cards labels are extremely small, but okay.

At 320 topbar match meta overlaps brand. Fix with media query max-width 360:
